                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>The patient’s estimated glomerular filtration rate (eGFR) is mildly decreased, consistent with stage 3a chronic kidney disease, which is common in elderly individuals. No acute kidney injury is indicated. Regular monitoring of renal function is recommended, and clinical correlation for comorbidities and medication dosing is advised.</td>
